<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Arabian Drilling Co 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Arabian Drilling Co 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  8.1     vs	5.9</p>
<p> Operating income	154.2     vs    141.9</p>
<p> Operating expenses    134.8     vs    123.5</p>
<p> Net operating income   19.4     vs     18.3</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   125.9     vs    125.7</p>
<p> Assets		    262.1     vs    206.0</p>
<p>Full Name: Arabian Drilling Company.</p>
<p>Note: The company operates in Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain Newsroom - 973-524424.</p>
</text>
